  "sourceReview": "All 240 selected original images were reviewed before predictions on ten numbered contact sheets. Twelve full-resolution images checked: FaceOcc2 77\u201380 and 88\u201391; Walking2 26,60,96,120. FaceOcc2: the face remains visible, with a book covering its lower portion during81\u201389; small boundary contact77\u201380 and90 is uncertain. No full disappearance occurs in the fixed120-image source interval. Walking2: the foreground target remains unobstructed while receding in a corridor with other people. Two independently source-marked competitor rectangles are supplied at four evaluation frames26,60,96,120 only; no interpolation, exhaustive distractor labelling or named-person identity claim. Source rectangles come from OTB; visibility and competitor rectangles are separate AI source-only review, not independent human adjudication. Generated controls supply separate exact occlusion/copy geometry. No complete-camera-occlusion qualification or source replacement is claimed.",
